      "SUBMIT_ASSESSMENT": "advisory read projection only: permission SUBMIT_ASSESSMENT + read-only ProjectScopeApi inspect + actor is task owner + NEW_PLATFORM + P2/GRADE_CONFIRMING + current DRAFT assessment + complete answers + manual grade + read-only Owner inspect reports the stored facts currently comparable and customer service level AVAILABLE; the submit command independently performs authoritative lockAndRevalidate"
