      "readOnly": true,
      "flow": "resolve complete DeviceScopeFactApi facts; group by currentProjectId; filter each group with ProjectScopeApi.ACTION_EDIT without narrowing participant/responsible/explicit-authorization semantics; resolve project/office/customer and AVAILABLE or NOT_CONFIGURED customer-service-level facts; inspect current ImplementationReadinessApi fact for each exact project/device set; list every currently applicable published configuration code; return every authorized project candidate and configuration choice without choosing either server-side",
